1
00:00:15,825 --> 00:00:16,575
Bye.

2
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:20,700
Hey!

3
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,191
Keep in touch.

4
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:38,875
Let's try latte art today.

5
00:00:38,875 --> 00:00:39,625
Okay.

6
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,525
Watch closely. Here's the trick.

7
00:00:41,525 --> 00:00:43,125
You have to do it like this.

8
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:50,000
See?

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:50,625
There you go.

10
00:00:50,625 --> 00:00:51,525
Oh my God!

11
00:00:51,575 --> 00:00:52,475
Smell it.

12
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:53,700
That's amazing!

13
00:00:53,925 --> 00:00:54,550
Have a taste.

14
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:55,300
Teach me too.

15
00:00:58,250 --> 00:00:59,000
It's okay.

16
00:00:59,100 --> 00:00:59,850
Your latte art

17
00:00:59,875 --> 00:01:00,750
is quite artistic.

18
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:02,100
Really?

19
00:01:03,225 --> 00:01:04,475
Does it taste good?

20
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,400
Coffee's too bitter.

21
00:01:08,475 --> 00:01:10,125
I prefer juice.

22
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:25,700
Inner Monologue

23
00:02:36,575 --> 00:02:37,700
You're here.

24
00:02:38,475 --> 00:02:40,100
Know why I wanted to meet here?

25
00:02:40,675 --> 00:02:41,425
Of course.

26
00:02:41,675 --> 00:02:43,150
This is where we first met.

27
00:02:43,998 --> 00:02:44,800
Clever boy.

28
00:02:45,475 --> 00:02:47,050
Then I'll tell you another secret.

29
00:02:47,424 --> 00:02:48,174
Okay.

30
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:51,325
You're going to be a dad.

31
00:02:51,950 --> 00:02:53,200
I'm going to be a dad?

32
00:02:53,375 --> 00:02:54,250
No...

33
00:02:54,350 --> 00:02:55,675
This can't happen.

34
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:57,650
My fate is already decided.

35
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:00,500
I have to let go of this love that should
never have been.

36
00:03:00,650 --> 00:03:01,700
Goodbye,

37
00:03:01,725 --> 00:03:02,775
Zhao Yidie.

38
00:03:27,537 --> 00:03:28,287
Hello.

39
00:03:28,325 --> 00:03:29,125
Detention centre.

40
00:03:29,125 --> 00:03:30,000
Am I speaking

41
00:03:30,025 --> 00:03:31,350
to Li Weishi?

42
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:33,125
Speaking.

43
00:03:34,875 --> 00:03:35,875
As procedure requires,

44
00:03:36,077 --> 00:03:38,077
the condemned prisoner, Zhao Yidie,

45
00:03:38,277 --> 00:03:40,277
has requested a final call with you.

46
00:03:42,575 --> 00:03:44,000
You know,

47
00:03:44,525 --> 00:03:45,425
that day,

48
00:03:46,650 --> 00:03:47,750
I'd already chosen

49
00:03:48,175 --> 00:03:49,575
a name for our baby.

50
00:03:51,775 --> 00:03:52,975
Xiaodie...

51
00:03:57,950 --> 00:03:58,700
Honey!

52
00:03:59,050 --> 00:03:59,800
You're here.

53
00:04:00,125 --> 00:04:01,400
I'm starving.

54
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,725
Shall we go for barbecue?

55
00:04:03,050 --> 00:04:05,050
That place over there is really good.

56
00:04:05,475 --> 00:04:06,225
How about it?

57
00:04:17,625 --> 00:04:18,500
Honey.

58
00:04:19,050 --> 00:04:20,575
Is something bothering you today?

59
00:04:21,125 --> 00:04:23,125
I... I came to break up with you.

60
00:04:25,725 --> 00:04:26,550
What did you say?

61
00:04:27,150 --> 00:04:28,975
I've been meaning to tell you.

62
00:04:29,325 --> 00:04:30,000
It's over.

63
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,200
Why?

64
00:04:32,700 --> 00:04:33,725
Give me more time.

65
00:04:33,725 --> 00:04:35,350
Then I can tell you everything.

66
00:04:36,225 --> 00:04:37,361
It's nothing you've done.

67
00:04:37,550 --> 00:04:38,900
It's me.

68
00:04:39,350 --> 00:04:41,032
So you've been lying to me all along?

69
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:43,600
Weishi returned to the future
to live with Yidie.

70
00:05:00,625 --> 00:05:02,025
I finish work early today.

71
00:05:02,025 --> 00:05:02,889
Pick me up at noon?

72
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,864
Does it taste good?

73
00:05:35,050 --> 00:05:37,050
Coffee's too bitter.

74
00:05:37,050 --> 00:05:38,125
I prefer juice.

75
00:06:01,325 --> 00:06:02,150
Actually,

76
00:06:02,150 --> 00:06:03,225
I have a secret too.

77
00:06:04,250 --> 00:06:05,725
I'll tell you when I'm ready.

78
00:06:15,175 --> 00:06:16,675
Let me take you home first.

79
00:06:29,250 --> 00:06:30,693
You're the one who cheated!

80
00:06:31,450 --> 00:06:32,650
You bastard!

81
00:06:33,450 --> 00:06:35,150
I never want to see you again!

82
00:06:35,150 --> 00:06:36,000
Get lost!

83
00:07:08,350 --> 00:07:09,100
It's okay.

84
00:07:09,374 --> 00:07:10,601
Go and sit down over there.

85
00:07:17,975 --> 00:07:18,782
Hello? Police?

86
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:20,325
We've crashed!

87
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,400
I believe you now.

88
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:33,100
But your past self is dead now.

89
00:07:34,850 --> 00:07:36,350
When you return to the future,

90
00:07:36,350 --> 00:07:37,441
what will happen to you?

91
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,100
I can't go back.

92
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,625
Maybe

93
00:07:41,625 --> 00:07:42,905
these are my final moments.

94
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:46,560
Maybe this is the price of changing fate.

95
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:49,873
In this world, neither of you knows me.

96
00:07:50,375 --> 00:07:51,475
But...

97
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,182
at least you're both safe.

98
00:07:54,825 --> 00:07:56,587
The time I spent with you...

99
00:07:56,587 --> 00:07:58,025
I was truly happy.
